{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\" initial=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml012-atomic-initial.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml012-atomic-initial.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":12,"byteOffset":89,"endColumn":28,"endLine":2,"startColumn":16,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the `initial` attribute"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml012-atomic-initial.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":28,"endLine":2,"startColumn":17,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"atomic state cannot declare an initial configuration\n\n**Note:** `initial` selects child states; a state without child states has nothing to initialize\n\n**Help:** remove the initial configuration or add child states\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>","text":"atomic state cannot declare an initial configuration"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":101,"start":90},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML012"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml012-atomic-initial.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":27,"endLine":2,"startColumn":26,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"initial state `a` is not a descendant of this element\n\n**Note:** a state's `initial` attribute may only name its own descendants; the root's may only name states in the document\n\n**Help:** target a descendant state owned by this compound state or SCXML root\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>","text":"initial state `a` is not a descendant of this element"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":100,"start":99},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"target declared here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml012-atomic-initial.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":15,"endLine":2,"startColumn":14,"startLine":2}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML017"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`initial` selects child states; a state without child states has nothing to initialize"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: remove the initial configuration, or add the child states it refers to.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML012` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#state","id":"SCXML012","name":"SCXML012","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an atomic state declares an initial configuration"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a state's `initial` attribute may only name its own descendants; the root's may only name states in the document"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: target a descendant of the element that declares `initial`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML017` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#state","id":"SCXML017","name":"SCXML017","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an `initial` attribute targets a state outside its element"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}